            "heading": "",
            "text": "A personality development course for students should build specific skills such as communication, confidence, teamwork, time management and presentation through practice, and the way to judge it is whether you leave with demonstrable improvement rather than a certificate or a promise of a new personality."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Choose a course with practice and feedback, set two measurable goals and keep a record of before and after."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Proof you can show supports an earlier path to financial freedom."
          }
